<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-8 offset-md-2">
        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">GoHost is a demo project.</p>
        <p>When you sign up we store your username, email address and a hashed password (never the password itself).
           We also store the listings, reviews and bookings you create, and a session cookie that keeps you logged in for up to a week.</p>
        <p>Listing images are stored with our image host, and listing locations are looked up with a mapping service to show the map.</p>
        <p>We don't sell your data or show ads.</p>
    </div>
</div>
